WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.269
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.604
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.873
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.541
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.543
The Biden administration
announced yesterday

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:13.379
that it will reopen
U.S. land borders next month

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:16.549
with Canada and Mexico,
but only to travelers

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.885
who are fully vaccinated
against the coronavirus,

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:21.387
because let's face it --
if you're not vaccinated,

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.389
you're not safe here.

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:24.557
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.726
The Biden administration
is set this week to host

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:29.228
a virtual
counter-ransomware summit

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:32.899
to discuss ways to combat
global cybercriminal networks.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:36.236
I'm sorry -- this guy
wants to talk cybercrime?

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.404
What's his advice gonna be?

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.241
"I write my password
on the back of a Post-it."

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.241
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:45.077
"They never look at the back!"

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:48.414
Former President Trump
is reportedly close to a deal

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:51.250
to sell his company's
Washington, D.C., hotel

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.086
to Spirit Halloween.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.420
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.588
[ Laughing ] According --

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.423
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.259
According to a new report

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.093
from the Congressional
Budget Office,

00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:05.431
federal tax revenues went up
by 18% in the last fiscal year,

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:08.934
which is the largest
one-year jump in 44 years.

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:11.938
Everyone got so bored
during quarantine,

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.607
they actually did their taxes.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.776
"I dunno, it's this
or play Scrabble again."

00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:21.281
The FDA yesterday authorized
an electronic cigarette

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.950
for the first time,
because one way or another,

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.285
they will vaccinate Florida.

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.454
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:31.624
The Social Security --

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.293
The Social Security
Administration announced today

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:37.963
that beneficiaries will see
a 5.9% increase

00:01:37.963 --> 00:01:39.966
in their benefit checks
next year.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.635
Said Grandma, "Get in, bitch!"

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.637
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:49.308
Actor Mark Harmon on Monday
exited the show "NCIS"

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:50.810
after 18 seasons.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.312
Man, and Grandma was having
such a good day

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:55.315
with that Social Security news.

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:57.316
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:58.818
[ Laughs ]

00:01:58.818 --> 00:01:59.986
"Get in, bitch!"

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.487
"No, Grandma,
you've got to get out.

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:02.922
I have some Mark --

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.925
I have some Mark Harmon news."

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.928
The fast food chain Wendy's
has announced a new partnership

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.597
with Google to implement
artificial intelligence

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:13.599
to improve the quality
of their restaurants.

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.101
And if you want the chili,

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.103
just click on "Feeling Lucky."

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:18.771
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:21.440
Netflix announced yesterday
that "Squid Game"

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.611
is officially its biggest-ever
series launch.

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:27.079
But remember, their
second-biggest launch

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:30.750
was the 1981 BBC show
"Old Scottish Detective."

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.285
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.587
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.587 --> 00:02:37.089
That was Baze and I --

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:38.758
that was our favorite joke
of the day.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.260
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.761
And let me tell you,
if none of you were here,

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.930
it would've gone just as well
as all the other jokes.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.764
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:47.200
[ Laughs ]

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.601
That's right, "Squid Game" is
officially the biggest ever

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:50.736
Netflix series launch.

00:02:50.736 --> 00:02:52.104
Even more disturbing --

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:55.407
Sallie Mae wants to option
the idea for student loans.

00:02:55.407 --> 00:02:58.077
[ Laughter ]
And final--

00:02:58.077 --> 00:03:00.413
Move over,
"Old Scottish Detective"!

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:01.414
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.449
[ Laughing ]

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:09.255
Those were our two
"Squid Game" jokes.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.289
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:11.924
The biggest show --
The biggest show,

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:14.761
and we're like, "Here's the way
we're gonna go at it."

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.595
"Old Scottish Detective,"
student loans.

00:03:16.595 --> 00:03:18.564
[ Laughs ]

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:20.566
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:24.237
11% of Americans said that
they always use their phone

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.738
while going to the bathroom.

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.407
The rest use toilet paper.

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:29.242
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:30.576
Scollins!

00:03:30.576 --> 00:03:32.078
That was a monologue, everybody.

